     "<div dir=\"ltr\">This is a good question, I also want to know a simple way to make this work. Did you make any progress?<div><br></div><div>All I&#39;ve found so far is the example at<span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"> </span><a href=\"https://github.com/richfitz/wood/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(0,89,153);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/richfitz/wood/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242323865000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_gsWN8xfGQFkLBgJNloP-\">richfitz/wood</a>, but that looks more complex than what I think I need. I&#39;ve also asked this on SO just now: <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/q/39009579/1036500\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/q/39009579/1036500&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242323865000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CDoWhqXhyYWGaDDyc9tfU\">http://stackoverflow.com/q/39009579/1036500</a><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"> </span></div></div>"
